        "content": [
          "In the beginning, the process starts with Bill for Purchased Goods/Services and then Receive Invoice.",
          "If the invoice is incomplete, it is returned. However, if the invoice is complete, the process continues.",
          "If the invoice is non-compliant, further checks are conducted. On the other hand, if the invoice is compliant, the process continues.",
          "If the issue can be resolved with a phone call, non-compliance is resolved. But if the issue requires mail back, the invoice is returned.",
          "After that, the invoice is paid and if it is returned, non-compliance is resolved.",
          "Bill Client.",
          "client is notified of the payment.",
          "If the client is unsatisfied, payment discrepancy is resolved. However, if the client is satisfied, the process continues."
        ]
      },
